
# Appended to sshd_config on the Alpine test servers, which have PAM (TestServers/README.md):
# shello-2fa signs in with its key and then a one-time code, as a server with two-factor sign-in
# asks. A Match block runs to the end of the file, so it goes last.
Match User shello-2fa
    AuthenticationMethods publickey,keyboard-interactive
